{"sections":[{"slug":"J-全纯曲线","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"J-全纯曲线"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“J-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯曲线</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“J-全纯曲线”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>J-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯曲线可用于研究</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/辛流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">辛流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的整体结构</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的形变</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> J <span lang=\"zh\">指</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/近复结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/近复流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(M,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $J$-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯曲线是</span> $(j,J)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":" $u\\colon (\\Sigma,j)\\to (M,J)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $(\\Sigma,j)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">通常我们取</span> $(\\Sigma,j)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">球面</span> $\\mathbb{C}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $u$ <span lang=\"zh\">为嵌入</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其像为</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维子流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且切空间是</span> $J$-<span lang=\"zh\">不变子空间</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">反之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $C\\subset M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维子流形</span>, $TC\\subset TM$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $J$-<span lang=\"zh\">不变子空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的限制可积</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维实流形上的任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/近复结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">都可积</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $J$-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯参数化</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">顺服于</span> (tamed by) $\\omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">是指对任意非零向量</span> $X$,\n$$\r\n\\omega(X,JX) &gt; 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span></h2>\n<p>$J$-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯曲线的关键事实是其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">一般为有限维</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且模空间的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类不依赖于</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">的选取</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只要</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">顺服于</span> $\\omega$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A\\in H_2(M,\\mathbb{Z})$, <span lang=\"zh\">所有代表</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $J$-<span lang=\"zh\">全纯曲线构成模空间</span> $\\mathcal M(A,J)$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}